Dear Professor Dinjanglu,
I hope this email finds you well. As a member of the organizing committee
for our upcoming annual tech-fest, Viwentiaa 2026, I am writing to provide
you with a comprehensive update on our preparation progress.
We have successfully finalized several key milestones over the past few
weeks. The event schedule is now locked in, all external guest speakers
have confirmed their attendance, and the registration portal is officially
live. Additionally, our media team has launched the social media
promotional campaign, which has already generated significant interest
among students.
Our main focus for the upcoming week is to wrap up the remaining logistics.
We still need to finalize the catering arrangements for the guest speakers,
secure the physical venue layouts with the campus facilities team, and
distribute the technical equipment checklist to each event volunteer.
Could you please let me know if you are available for a brief 10-minute
check-in meeting this Thursday at 3:00 PM to review the final budget
allocation?
Thank you for your continuous guidance and oversight as our faculty
coordinator.
Sincerely,
chandu,
Organizing Committee Member, Viwentiaa 2026
KLH Bachupally

